---
/**
 * The "Takeaway" callout from the original project page: a tinted box that
 * states what a results figure actually shows, so a reader skimming the
 * figures still gets the conclusion.
 */
---

<aside
  class="not-prose border-secondary-accent/70 bg-muted my-6 rounded-lg border-l-[4px] px-5 py-4"
>
  <span
    class="text-secondary-accent mr-2 text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.08em] uppercase"
    >Takeaway</span
  >
  <span class="text-foreground text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed">
    <slot />
  </span>
</aside>
